# ============================================================
# Build output
# ============================================================

dist/

# Anchored to the repository root rather than matching every `build` directory anywhere.
# electron-builder's buildResources directory is apps/desktop/build, and it holds
# hand-authored release inputs (icon.ico, installer.nsh, the icons/ set); the unanchored
# `build/` rule this replaces left every one of them untracked, so `npm run
# package:desktop` and .github/workflows/release.yml could not run from a clean checkout.
# The root-level build/ stays ignored — it is a local scratch area for repro scripts and
# test screenshots. The one generated subtree under the desktop one is excluded at the
# bottom of this file (apps/desktop/build/nsis/).
/build/

# ============================================================
# Electron
# ============================================================

release/
# NOT `electron-builder.yml`: it is the installer's packaging configuration and a required
# build input (apps/desktop/package.json's `package` script passes it with --config, and
# .github/workflows/release.yml runs that). It contains no secrets — signing material
# comes from CSC_LINK/CSC_KEY_PASSWORD in the environment.
*.asar

